}\wedge e_{j_{3}}\wedge e_{j_{4}}\wedge e_{j_{5}}\wedge e_{j_{6}}\wedge
e_{j_{7}}\operatorname{Pf}\left\{  \Xi_{\left\vert EE\right\rangle }\left(
