}\wedge e_{j_{2}}\wedge e_{j_{3}}\wedge e_{j_{4}}\wedge e_{j_{5}}\wedge
e_{j_{6}}\wedge e_{j_{7}}\operatorname{Pf}\left\{  \Xi_{\left\vert
EE\right\rangle }\left(  g\right)  \left(  j_{1}j_{2}j_{3}j_{4}j_{5}j_{6}%
